    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME as official 'Knowledge Partners' of The MagnifiScience Centre organised a series of simulation-based workshops 'Magnifi-Sim' in the first quarter of 2022. This series was aimed at informing the public on commonly encountered healthcare situations, using the latest techniques of simulation based education with technology.",
